#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:1
msgid "Wuning Science Park"
msgstr "上海武宁科技园"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:4
msgid "上海武宁科技园"
msgstr "上海武宁科技园"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Putuo | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜普陀区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Hardware AI, Industry."
msgstr "人工智能与产业方向：硬件人工智能、产业。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:10
msgid ""
"An industrial research and testing environment operated by the Shanghai "
"Electrical Apparatus Research Institute group. Robot and "
"industrial-internet testing are useful entry points for hardware "
"validation."
msgstr "由上海电器科学研究所集团运营的工业研发与检测园区。机器人及工业互联网检测可作为硬件验证对接方向。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S013 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_. "
"上海武宁科技园_创业园区_上海市普陀区人民政府."
msgstr "`证据 S013 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_. 上海武宁科技园_创业园区_上海市普陀区人民政府."

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方来源与主管部门入口 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:26
msgid ""
"Published address: Wuning Road area, Putuo; confirm the service building."
msgstr "公布地址：普陀区武宁路片区，服务楼宇需确认。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:28
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网联系负责团队，确认现行申请渠道。本刊不刊载邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:37
msgid ""
"Describe the prototype, required equipment, process and testing needs."
msgstr "说明样机、所需设备、工艺与测试需求。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:39
msgid "Ask for a technical review, facility visit and itemized quotation."
msgstr "申请技术审核、设施参观及逐项报价。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:41
msgid ""
"Agree access, safety, sample and IP ownership, test scope and acceptance."
msgstr "约定准入、安全、样本与知识产权、测试范围及验收。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:43
msgid ""
"Separate the facility contract from investment or public-funding "
"applications."
msgstr "设施合同与投资或财政资助分别申请。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:45
msgid ":doc:`Putuo district route </districts/putuo>`"
msgstr ":doc:`普陀区对接路径 </districts/putuo>`"

